<h2>Events</h2>

<section class="fill-main">
    <div class="raised">
        <div class="event">
            <h3 class="ll">Love & Logic<br><span class="sub">Jan-Feb 2027 6-Week Course</span></h3>
            <p> 
                Love & Logic Class is a 6-week course. These classes are for anyone involved in raising or caring for children—parents,
                grandparents, aunts, uncles, guardians or anyone who plays an important role in a
                child's life. Learn positive, loving and practical tools to help raise happy, confident and
                well-behaved children.
            </p>
            <p>
                Earn incentive points as you participate in this program.
            </p>
            <p>When: Begins on Tuesday, January 12th, then every Tuesday 5:30pm-7:00pm for 6 weeks through February 16th</p>
            <p>Where: Westminster Presbyterian Church in Chehalis located at 349 N Market Blvd, Chehalis, WA 98532</p>
            <a class="external" href="/love-and-logic">Learn More</a>
        </div>

        <hr class="for-space">

        <div class="event">
            <h3 class="ff">Faith and Finance<br><span class="sub">Jan-March 2027 10-Week Course</span></h3>
