                The course is free which includes participants' guidebook, and you have the ability to earn incentive 
                points while attending each class. 
                These earned incentive points could off-set costs for your rent, utilities, gasoline, food or other expenses. 
            </p>
            <p>When: Begins on Tuesday, January 12th, then every Tuesday 5:30pm-7:00pm for 10 weeks through March 16th</p>
            <p>Where: Westminster Presbyterian Church in Chehalis located at 349 N Market Blvd, Chehalis, WA 98532</p>
            <a class="external" href="/faith-and-finance">Learn More</a>
        </div>

